        "@value": "Chemists (Amendment) Bill 1998"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/10/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/10/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Chemists (Amendment)"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Act 1998 and shall come into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/10/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/10/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Chemists Act 1975, which is referred to in this"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Act as the \"principal Act\", is amended in the national language text by substituting for the word \"Institiut\" wherever it appears the word \"Institut\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/10/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/10/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "11 the following section: Members 11A. No person shall be a member of the of Council, or any Committee, of the Institute or Council, Commit- a committee of any branch of the Institute unless tees, etc., he is a citizen of Malaysia.\". must be citizens."
